Package: warpsandbox
Title: A Test Sandbox for Raster Warp Engines
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Michael", "Sumner", email = "mdsumner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A catalogue of cloud-ready raster sources and (later) a plumber2
    service that warps them with several engines (rwarp, GDAL via gdalraster,
    vapour and GDAL7) and compares the results.
